{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09463","headline":"酒肆行 · 韦应物","name":"酒肆行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"豪家沽酒长安陌，一旦起楼高百尺。\n碧疏玲珑含春风，银题彩帜邀上客。\n回瞻丹凤阙，直视乐游苑。\n四方称赏名已高，五陵车马无近远。\n晴景悠扬三月天，桃花飘俎柳垂筵。\n繁丝急管一时合，他垆邻肆何寂然。\n主人无厌且专利，百斛须臾一壶费。\n初醲後薄爲大偷，饮者知名不知味。\n深门潜酝客来稀，终岁醇醲味不移。\n长安酒徒空扰扰，路傍过去那得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}